  "claim_scope": "A pinned 3.7M-parameter pretrained TinyStories GPT-Neo model is adapted on a safe generated marker-to-color next-token task with disjoint held-out templates. Rank-1 LoRA, rank-4 LoRA, and full-model finetuning use the same examples, batches, step counts, objective, and protected-task replay, with explicit method-specific learning rates. The learner compares behavior, selected real-transformer update spectra, layer-6 activation drift, and causal removal of the dominant adapter-induced direction against base, random-label, same-norm random low-rank, and random-direction controls. This is template-generalization evidence, not a broad PEFT equivalence claim.",
